# Milestone 26: inline formatting outside Markdown (reference/common/text-formatting.md). Page of
# 200 × 200 with margins of 20: page area of 160 × 160 from (20, 20). Lines of 12 (Size 10);
# at 5 pt per character, 32 characters fit per line.
#
# Document declares Markup: markdown and all the text inherits it. The marks (**, \) have no width:
# the text measures what is seen.
#   lit:     Markup: none; "**aaaa** **bbbb** **cccc** **dddd**" is literal: 35 characters, so
#            2 lines (three words of 8 fit in 26; the fourth takes it to 35): 24. From y = 20.
#   fmt:     the same with inherited Markup: "aaaa bbbb cccc dddd" is 19 characters: 1 line, 12. y = 44.
#   escaped: with \* in front, the asterisks are literal: 35 characters again, 2 lines: 24. y = 56.
#   blocks:  a Block with two Paragraph with Content; the single line break of the first counts as a
#            space: each one is one line: 24. y = 80.
#   tab:     a Cell 80 wide (16 characters): "**aaaa** **bbbb**" as literal text would be 17 and two
#            lines; interpreted, "aaaa bbbb" is one line: the row and the table measure 12. y = 104.
#   md:      a Markdown is not interpreted twice: "\*\*aaaa\*\* ..." gives 35 literal characters
#            (Markup: markdown is inherited, but does not act inside it): 2 lines, 24. y = 116.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 200
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
				Markup: markdown
	Section:
		Text: **aaaa** **bbbb** **cccc** **dddd**
			Id: lit
			Typography:
				Markup: none
		Text: **aaaa** **bbbb** **cccc** **dddd**
			Id: fmt
		Text: \*\*aaaa\*\* \*\*bbbb\*\* \*\*cccc\*\* \*\*dddd\*\*
			Id: escaped
		Block:
			Id: blocks
			Paragraph:
				Content >>
					Uno *dos* ++tres++
					cuatro.
			Paragraph:
				Content >>
					Cinco ~~seis~~.
		Table:
			Id: tab
			Column sizes: 80 80
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: **aaaa** **bbbb**
					Cell: [web](https://a.example)
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Content >>
				\*\*aaaa\*\* \*\*bbbb\*\* \*\*cccc\*\* \*\*dddd\*\*
